  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Live Power Line Maintenance Training, through Southeast Lineman Training Center, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance (TA) would provide training on live line maintenance practices to electrical lineworkers at the State Grid Corporation of China (SGCC). SGCC currently shuts down the particular segment of the grid during maintenance activity, leading to outages in the areas being served, whereas in the United States, maintenance is conducted without shutting down the subject area. This TA would entail a customized 20-week program consisting of both classroom and field training at SGCC&apos;s training facility in Jinan, Shandong Province.</narrative>
  </description>
